eight=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558400/extras/b98c6e2e9a768ab762fe5a75a1973ddb.webm?t=1771367610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car may be an ancient piece of junk, but they don’t make ‘em like they used to. Every component is swappable with something else. <strong>No brake pedal? No problem.</strong> Just snap a cassette tape where the pedal used to be. Good as new!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friend Pass - Bring Along a Friend FREE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who owns a copy of Backseat Drivers can play with one person who doesn't! If <strong>one </strong>of you owns the game, <strong>both </strong>of you can play together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Friend Pass is limited to 1 free player per 1 paid player. For a <strong>3 or 4-player co-op</strong> session, a minimum of <strong>2 paid copies</strong> of the game are required.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
